 "text": "Hi, how you doing right now? A balanced meal that's easy to eat with one hand is the way to go. Soup, a jacket potato with cheese and some bacon, then stick to yellow foods. A sweet potato with cheese and bacon, an egg baked in milk, or toast with peanut butter and banana. Try muesli with milk or yogurt, or an omelette with fruit in it. Smooth blends are easier on sick tummies. Letting her stir the soup or add the cheese builds confidence and memories.",
